  "bodyHash": "61c878cdfdf3ce19",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Aether 废墟传送门 ✨</h1>\n<p><strong>本模组</strong>&nbsp;为《我的世界》添加了<strong>Aether 废墟传送门</strong>，散布于<strong>主世界各生物群系与海洋</strong>中，为<strong>原版游戏</strong>增添了更丰富的设定🗺️</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/68a4ced6606aaaedb4a0be65ed83e528db6f425b.jpeg\" alt=\"天界废墟传送门宣传图\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp &copy; - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>注意事项📝 (Notes)</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Aether 废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;兼容版本<strong>1.20 至 1.21.11</strong>🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>Aether 废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;为世界生成添加了新的<strong>结构（建筑）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>Aether 废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;兼容任何<strong>世界生成类模组</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Aether 废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;已翻译为超过<strong>20 种语言</strong></li>\n<li><strong>无需</strong>&nbsp;解压下载的文件 🗂️</li>\n<li>建议使用<strong>耳机</strong>&nbsp;以获得<strong>更佳体验</strong>&nbsp;🎧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>信息 🎼 (Information)</h2>\n<p><strong>本模组</strong>&nbsp;是以下项目的<strong>兼容性更新与扩展</strong>（代码致谢与灵感来源）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ruined-aether-portals-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ruined Aether Portals</a>&nbsp;作者：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/moralle/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moralle</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252faether-ruined-portals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Data Pack: Ruined Portals</a>&nbsp;作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fthe-aether-team\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether Team</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>传送门生成机制🌐 (Generation)</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>天界废墟传送门</p>\n<h2>天界废墟传送门变体数量：15</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"萤石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af8458e419bf5e19e66d0c9b6d03a007460d6a9e.jpeg\" alt=\"天界废墟传送门\"></p>\n<p><strong>天界废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;生成于<strong>主世界</strong>&nbsp;中（不包含主世界的海洋生物群系）。若需通过<strong>指令</strong>&nbsp;定位，请使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>下界天界废墟传送门</p>\n<h2>天界废墟传送门变体数量：14</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"萤石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a0565afdff18a95665f2df1ad83276434480c860.jpeg\" alt=\"下界天界废墟传送门\"></p>\n<p><strong>下界天界废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;生成于<strong>下界</strong>&nbsp;中。若需通过<strong>指令</strong>&nbsp;定位，请使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal_nether</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>海洋天界废墟传送门</p>\n<h2>天界废墟传送门变体数量：15</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"萤石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df3689fa72ba9cd30fea3d14a40a5c4ab73c276d.jpeg\" alt=\"海洋天界废墟传送门\"></p>\n<p><strong>海洋天界废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;生成于<strong>所有海洋生物群系</strong>&nbsp;中。若需通过<strong>指令</strong>&nbsp;定位，请使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:ruined_aether_portal_ocean</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>巨型天界废墟传送门</p>\n<h2>天界废墟传送门变体数量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"萤石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/11ef842d6b2aa6c21b8095a6ee2fa87525d75c7d.jpeg\" alt=\"Aether 废墟传送门 巨型\"></p>\n<p><strong>巨型天界废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;生成于<strong>主世界</strong>&nbsp;中（不包含主世界的海洋生物群系）。若需通过<strong>指令</strong>&nbsp;定位，请使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:giant_ruined_aether_portal</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>巨型海洋天界废墟传送门</p>\n<h2>天界废墟传送门变体数量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"萤石粉物品\">&nbsp;<strong>宣传图片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/13fdd787abc35b798ba6bb2a3906f6e60e21dca8.jpeg\" alt=\"Aether 废墟传送门 巨型海洋\"></p>\n<p><strong>巨型海洋天界废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;生成于<strong>所有海洋生物群系</strong>&nbsp;中。若需通过<strong>指令</strong>&nbsp;定位，请使用：</p>\n<p><code>/locate structure luistercorp:giant_ruined_aether_portal_ocean</code></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新成就 🏆 (New Advancements)</h2>\n<p><strong>若您发现废墟传送门</strong>&nbsp;，将获得一个名为<strong>&ldquo;天堂维度？&rdquo;&rdquo;</strong>的<strong>新成就</strong>&nbsp;，显示效果如下：</p>\n<p>◾&nbsp;<strong>图片 (Image)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7bf8add85b9d8326619637619615038cb6158ddc.png\" alt=\"萤石粉物品\">：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f3629da067cf457a5ba97f50f13e92b543ec24b6.png\" alt=\"废墟传送门成就\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/caa13d665e5bbae5b82f271b571566af42085d2b.png\" alt=\"废墟传送门成就\"></p>",
